      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "To add on to this, the last few people I've talked to didn't even know status was a thing, or those who did thought it was a premium only feature.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
  ],
  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2021-10-12T05:39:14.563Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Custom status is an awesome feature, and many users have important info on there, like preferred pronouns. I'm not sure how many people bother to change the setting to always display people's status, let alone open the menu to check, or go into anyone's bio.\nI think it could help people feel more comfortable if it was more likely for their status to be seen by other players, by having it always display as the default. I suppose it might be annoying for some, but they could just turn the setting back off. \nThat's just my opinion though, I'm interested in what other people think.",
